---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../../config/site';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy | Kestrel Roofing Co." description="How Kestrel Roofing Co. handles the information you send through this website.">
  <article class="wrap py-[var(--spacing-section)]">
    <p class="t-label text-graphite">Privacy</p>
    <h1 class="t-h1 mt-3">Privacy policy</h1>
    <div class="measure mt-8 flex flex-col gap-5 text-graphite [&_h2]:mt-4 [&_h2]:text-h3 [&_h2]:font-bold [&_h2]:text-ink">
      <p><strong class="text-ink">This is a concept website for a fictional company.</strong> Forms are connected for demonstration only; please don’t send real personal details.</p>
      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>When you request an inspection we receive the details you type: problem type, ZIP code, name, phone number and, if you used the calculator, your estimate. Nothing else is collected through the form.</p>
      <h2>How we use it</h2>
      <p>Only to call you back about your roof. We don’t sell or share your details, and we don’t add you to marketing lists.</p>
      <h2>Analytics and cookies</h2>
      <p>This site sets no tracking cookies. If privacy-friendly analytics are enabled, they count page views without identifying you.</p>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions or a request to delete your details: {site.email} or {site.phone.display}.</p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
